    "norm": "Regression test for IO-277: encoding characters that cannot be mapped to the target charset must not cause {@link ReaderInputStream} to spin in an infinite loop. @see <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IO-277\">IO-277</a>"
